# Copy to .env.local if your backend runs somewhere other than the default.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Optional - only needed once you wire the student database over to Supabase
# (see lib/supabase.ts for what that migration involves). Until both of these
# are set, the app keeps using its local session + the FastAPI students table.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
